      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Definitely seconding this. The multithreading alone will be a sight for sore eyes, particularly for heavily-populated worlds. Additionally, the ability to set up a single dynamic bone system applied to multiple chains will simplify setup and reduce the amount of components and scripts on avatars with many dynamic bones, which should make them a bit more performant.\nI strongly believe it is worthwhile maintaining support for Dynamic Bone scripts for the time being until the in-house dynamics solution is implemented.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
