      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Okay, but when is \"soon\" going to be? The April dev stream stated that avatar dynamics would be implemented during the summer (assuming this is northern hemisphere summer) but we've not heard a peep about it since then. If there is something actually tangible to be shown off in the next month, then I can understand declining to update the existing scripts.",
