      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Could work until Physics Bones is implemented, but wouldn't keep Dynamic Bones out of date just to wait for physics bones until some time at the end of next year. People will just break ToS just to get the updated dynamic bones to work in game as it includes blend weights and for colliders, includes radius 2 option. with the option to enable/disable the collider object without disabling the gameobject itself.",
